      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not AC_CHANGE hook not triggered, because the safety test will short Q1008 H-side in \"DC mode\", which will cause VBUS to be higher than 3.6V and cause RAA48900 0x4D bit14(AC status) trigger high, “EC_ACOK_OTG” keep high to disable OVP circuit function (b/188567172#comment24).\nSo we must add one more condition to check that is \"Real Adapter connect\", so we use charge_manager_get_charger_voltage for checking. But when AC_CHANGE hook is trigger, it is not mean can get voltage from charge_manager_get_charger_voltage. So using HOOK_SECOND to instead.",
      "parentUuid": "98225c84_dace5d90",
